# Applies to every service build (context: . in docker-compose.yml and the
# release workflow) -- kept minimal and explicit on purpose: a bare `tests/`
# or `run.py` pattern here would also match paths that ARE needed inside the
# image, so every pattern below spells out the full path it targets.

services/api/tests/
services/api/requirements-test.txt
services/dashboard/tests/
services/dashboard/requirements-test.txt

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

.git/
.github/
.devcontainer/
.vscode/
.pre-commit/
.pre-commit-config.yaml

.env
.env.*
data/

README.md
docker-compose.yml
LICENSE
